WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.110
- We are back.

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:03.270
And you have seen it
happen from time to time

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.670
here on this show, I get
to talking with guests

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:08.760
and the conversations go along
'cause mama likes to talk.

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.770
That's why we keep a vault of interviews

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.360
we couldn't fit in the original show,

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.790
but we wanna make sure
that you don't miss.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.250
Today's Kelly Extra takes
us back to September

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.200
when we had Scarlett Johansson here.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.910
We got to talking about our kids

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:23.940
and one of the cardinal
Marvel Universe rules

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.500
she said she would never break.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.700
Check it out.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:27.840
When Jeremy Renner was here,

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.510
he was talking about he
used his Hawkeye costume

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:31.343
for Halloween.

00:00:31.343 --> 00:00:32.176
Have you ever done that?

00:00:32.176 --> 00:00:33.060
- What?

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:34.176
- You've never done that?

00:00:34.176 --> 00:00:35.009
- That is--
- I would totally do that.

00:00:35.009 --> 00:00:36.090
- That's allowed?

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:38.280
Marvel never told me I could do that.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:39.113
- I don't.

00:00:39.113 --> 00:00:40.920
I feel like Jeremy maybe says sorry,

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:41.880
doesn't ask permission.

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:43.050
Maybe he's one of those people.

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:43.950
- You're actually right.

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:44.783
That's definitely.

00:00:44.783 --> 00:00:45.753
- I'm one of those people.

00:00:45.753 --> 00:00:47.100
So yeah, 'cause then you
can always say sorry later.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.120
I would totally do it.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.330
- I'm not, I am very by
the books, like I don't,

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:54.300
I am the person that is, I don't wanna be

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.390
I'm constantly like, I worked
for Marvel for 10 years

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.030
and I was constantly
terrified I was gonna spoil

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:02.550
some major, yeah, like anything from like,

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:06.390
the color of my, that it's like
now a darker shade of navy,

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:08.250
it was like, you can't say a thing.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:09.083
- Oh wow.

00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:11.837
- I'm sort of programmed to, yeah.

00:01:11.837 --> 00:01:13.753
- Sounds a little abusive, but yeah.

00:01:13.753 --> 00:01:14.586
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:14.586 --> 00:01:15.420
Programmed.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.370
- What do you mean?
- Yeah.

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:19.560
I would, I don't do well with
secrets or anything like that

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:21.300
so I would hate that
having to keep a secret.

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.133
I don't, no.

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:25.500
- There is definitely cast
members that, Mark Ruffalo, yeah,

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.543
that are really, really bad at it,

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:29.400
that are like a liability.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.510
- I call it passion.

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:31.980
We're just excited about something.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.013
So that's why we give it away on accident.

